item.description:
Truth-tellers get unpopular on Wall Street right about the time everyone knows that everyone knows the suits are just doing it to get paid.

@KeithMcCullough has been fine with that since 2008.

In his words, "I don't do this to be popular. I do this because my life's steps matter."

On Thursday the market priced the risk of regulation on data centers and AI. SPX fell 4.4% & SOXX dropped 12.5%, its 2nd-largest daily decline on record behind only the COVID crash.

@t1alpha called it "an absolute master class in mechanical flows," with every major systematic seller hitting at once.

As a @Hedgeye sub, you were prepared. At noon today, the team will review where the flows go from here.

Tier one operators don’t leave the field when the shooting starts.

@KeithMcCullough was on the front lines with Real-Time Alerts subscribers all day, timestamping every buy and sell as the Nasdaq fell over 6%.

Get access to Real-Time Alerts: https://accounts.hedgeye.com/products/real-time-alerts/116!371

Phone ringing off hook.
Watch this below from 1 month ago to see how to trade AI and what is going to happen next.
@KeithMcCullough
@Hedgeye
